From 496f620f5a796428b5beef749901941ed2e42a9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:57:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(google): send as Gmail does: under a Message-ID and Date
 of its own, a draft as a new message

Gmail replaces the Message-ID and Date of mail sent by messages.send or
drafts.send, and sends a draft as a new message of its thread, the draft
then gone (so sending it again is 404). Drafts also take a multipart
upload's media as their raw message.
---
